{#- Approved (to the nominee) · Nominations. Sender: Admin NominationsController::sendNomineeForm.
    Variables: programme, first_name, category, due, voting_opens, form_url, page_url.
    Design: Email Templates.dc.html → "Approved", corrected to the live site (owner, 19 Oct
    2026): the nominee's page is live from approval, so the design's "one step left before
    your page goes live" is not what happens; `due` is the date the link expires
    (NomineeDetails::LINK_DAYS). Since 30 Oct 2026 the link signs the nominee in or makes their
    account, and their profile then stays on that account to update any time. -#}
{% extends 'emails/_layout.html.twig' %}
{% block category %}Nominations{% endblock %}
{% block hero %}illo-sealed{% endblock %}
{% block why %}Your nomination for an Africa GATES award was approved.{% endblock %}
{% block subject %}Congratulations — finish your Africa GATES nominee profile{% endblock %}
{% block preheader %}You’re a nominee for {{ category }}. Make your account and add your details.{% endblock %}
{% block body %}
{%- import 'emails/_blocks.html.twig' as b -%}
{% if programme %}{{ b.eyebrow(programme) }}{% endif %}
{{ b.h1("You’re a nominee, #{first_name}") }}
{{ b.p('Your nomination has been checked and approved. Next, make your free account and finish your profile: your phone numbers and emails, photographs, and evidence of your work. No password; we send you a code.') }}
{{ b.p('Your profile stays on your account, so you can come back and update it any time. The reason you were nominated stays as your nominator wrote it.') }}
{% set _facts = [['Category', category], ['Link works until', due, 'b']] %}
{% if voting_opens %}{% set _facts = _facts|merge([['Voting opens', voting_opens]]) %}{% endif %}
{{ b.facts(_facts) }}
{{ b.button('Finish my profile', form_url) }}
{% if page_url %}{{ b.link('See your public page', page_url) }}{% endif %}
{% endblock %}
